  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MxR.Sign.WallSign
  title: Generic 3D Printer
  authorName: Linus Pihan
  description: 'An FDM 3D printer melts plastic filament in a heated nozzle and builds
    objects layer by layer. The print head moves left/right (X), the bed moves front/back
    (Y) and the gantry moves up (Z) after every layer.


    Choose a model with the arrows
    on the printer''s display, tap its middle to print.'
  initialStatus: 'Status: ready'
  size: {x: 0.9, y: 0.6}
